{"id": "16-2704-2-2", "zh": "以 d 结尾的词根", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-2705-2-5", "zh": "hada：义为排便。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-2705-6-10", "zh": "“排便”就是粪便的排出、排放。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-2705-11-14", "zh": "hadeti、hadayati（排便）。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-2705-15-18", "zh": "ohadeti、ohadayati（排泄）。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "16-2706-2-4", "zh": "vida：义为获得。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-2706-5-18", "zh": "在这里，“获得”指的是感受，所以应当理解为：vida 这个词根用于“感受”的意思。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-2706-19-22", "zh": "感受乐受（sukhaṃ vedanaṃ vedeti）。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-2706-23-26", "zh": "感受苦受（dukkhaṃ vedanaṃ vedeti）。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-2706-27-28", "zh": "vedayati（感受）。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-2706-29-32", "zh": "vedanā（受）、vitti（领受）。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "16-2706-33-34", "zh": "vedayitaṃ（所感受的）。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "16-2706-35-38", "zh": "正在感受乐受的人（sukhaṃ vedanaṃ vedayamāno）。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-2707-2-4", "zh": "kudi：义为说不实之言。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "16-2707-5-8", "zh": "kundeti、kundayati（说谎）。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "16-2708-2-4", "zh": "mida：义为爱着。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "16-2708-5-9", "zh": "这里的“爱着”指的是喜爱。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "16-2708-10-13", "zh": "medeti、medayati（爱着）。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "16-2709-2-4", "zh": "chada：义为遮盖。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-2709-5-9", "zh": "给房子盖屋顶（gehaṃ chādeti、chādayati）。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-2709-10-14", "zh": "掩盖过失（dosaṃ chādeti、chādayati）。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-2709-15-18", "zh": "paṭicchādeti、paṭicchādayati（隐藏）。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-2709-19-20", "zh": "chattaṃ（伞）。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-2709-21-23", "zh": "盖好了顶的小屋（channā kuṭi）。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-2710-2-6", "zh": "其中，chattaṃ 就是遮阳伞（ātapatta）。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-2710-7-10", "zh": "它遮挡日晒，所以叫 chattaṃ。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-2710-11-13", "zh": "它被遮盖起来，所以叫 channā。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-2711-2-5", "zh": "cuda：义为督促，也义为命令。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "16-2711-6-9", "zh": "codeti、codayati（督促、指控）。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "16-2711-10-15", "zh": "codako（指控者）、cuditako（被指控者）、codanā（指控）。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "16-2711-16-18", "zh": "受佛陀督促的阿难（Ānando buddhacodito）。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "16-2712-2-6", "zh": "其中，“**codanā**”就是动摇（cālanā）。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "16-2712-7-11", "zh": "“**cālanā**”的意思是把过失加在别人身上。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "16-2713-2-4", "zh": "chadda：义为吐出。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-2713-5-8", "zh": "chaddeti、chaddayati（吐出、抛弃）。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-2714-2-4", "zh": "mada：义为得到满足。", "confidence": 65}
{"id": "16-2714-5-8", "zh": "madeti、madayati（使满足）。", "confidence": 65}
{"id": "16-2715-2-4", "zh": "vida：义为认知、讲说、居住。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "16-2715-5-7", "zh": "“认知”就是辨识。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "16-2715-8-10", "zh": "“讲说”就是述说。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-2715-11-13", "zh": "“居住”就是住下来。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-2715-14-17", "zh": "vedeti、vedayati（知道、告知）。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "16-2715-18-21", "zh": "paṭivedeti、paṭivedayati（禀告）。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-2715-22-25", "zh": "大王，我向您禀告。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-2716-2-5", "zh": "sadda：义为发声。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-2716-6-9", "zh": "saddeti、saddayati（发声）。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-2716-10-13", "zh": "visaddeti、visaddayati（发出声音）。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "16-2716-14-17", "zh": "saddo（声音）、saddito（被发出声的）。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "16-2716-18-26", "zh": "元音拉长时，有“saddāyati”这个词形。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "16-2717-2-37", "zh": "这里，义注里的文句“以为‘它在叫我’，就急忙跳进水里”就是例证。不应当说这个词形像“pabbatāyati”那样不是依词根构成的，而应当理解为它正是依词根构成的。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "16-2717-38-45", "zh": "“**saddo**”：它被发出，所以叫 saddo；就像“它被说出，所以叫 vacana（语言）”一样。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "16-2717-46-52", "zh": "或者说，意义借它而被表达出来，所以叫 saddo。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "16-2717-53-59", "zh": "而老师们则说：“它被宣说，所以叫 saddo。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "16-2717-60-67", "zh": "意思是被说出、被讲述。”", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "16-2718-2-4", "zh": "sūda：义为浇注。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "16-2718-5-8", "zh": "sūdeti、sūdayati（浇注）。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "16-2718-9-10", "zh": "sūdo（厨师）。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-2719-2-14", "zh": "“**sūdo**”就是做饭的人，也叫“rasako”（厨子）。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-2720-2-4", "zh": "kanda：义为持续。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "16-2720-5-8", "zh": "“持续”就是恒常的状态、不间断的状态。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-2720-9-12", "zh": "kandeti、kandayati（持续）。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "16-2721-2-4", "zh": "muda：义为混合。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-2721-5-7", "zh": "“混合”就是合在一起。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-2721-8-13", "zh": "用酥油拌和炒麦粉（modeti、modayati sattūni sappinā）。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "16-2722-2-4", "zh": "nada：义为言说。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "16-2722-5-8", "zh": "nādeti、nādayati（发声、吼叫）。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "16-2722-9-24", "zh": "不应当说这些是使役形式，因为圣典里可以看到：“狮子以狮子吼，使达达罗山发出回响。”", "confidence": 65}
{"id": "16-2722-25-29", "zh": "在别处也不必对此怀疑。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "16-2722-30-36", "zh": "因为在这个 curādi 类里，可以看到一些外形像使役形式、其实是单纯主动形式的词。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "16-2723-2-4", "zh": "sada：义为品尝。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "16-2723-5-8", "zh": "sādeti、sādayati（品尝、享受）。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "16-2723-9-12", "zh": "assādeti、assādayati（品尝、享受）。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "16-2723-13-18", "zh": "这里的前缀 ā 是以短音的形式出现的。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "16-2724-2-4", "zh": "gada：义为天声。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "16-2724-5-8", "zh": "所谓“天声”，指的是雷鸣。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "16-2724-9-12", "zh": "gadeti、gadayati（打雷）。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "16-2725-2-5", "zh": "pada：义为行走。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "16-2725-6-9", "zh": "padeti、padayati（行走）。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "16-2725-10-11", "zh": "padaṃ（步、足迹）。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "16-2725-12-27", "zh": "在 divādi 类里，它的词形是“pajjati”；而在这里则是这样的形式。", "confidence": 75}
